@Notification_Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:64576
@token = paste-token-here
@notificationId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

GET {{Notification_Api_HostAddress}}/api/notifications/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

GET {{Notification_Api_HostAddress}}/api/notifications/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

POST {{Notification_Api_HostAddress}}/api/notifications/{{notificationId}}/read
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

POST {{Notification_Api_HostAddress}}/api/notifications/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
